## Cheat-sheet

| # | Name | Personality | Unique trick |
|---|---|---|---|
| **V1** | Neon / Cyberpunk | Dark, glowing borders, monospace font | Corner triangle cut + scan-line hover |
| **V2** | Post-it | Pastel, handwritten feel, tilted | Deterministic color/tilt from task ID |
| **V3** | Pill Row | Ultra-compact horizontal | Description appears inline on hover |
| **V4** | Flip Card | Two-sided | Front = summary, Back = full detail via 3D flip |
| **V5** | Brutalist | Bold, no-nonsense, hard borders | Offset shadow, UPPERCASE text, solid tag fills |
